t you, of course!) if you accept my request ^^\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NlxnTrOzJLNXbXuBMrSYLmcHDLPJNZqd?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NM_syndrome/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/514d7c3c/uploads/origins/4924a397-e1df-46a8-890c-cc889aede510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e8fdca4c3f7e54e3a3e970838567bbd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/514d7c3c/uploads/origins/4924a397-e1df-46a8-890c-cc889aede510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e8fdca4c3f7e54e3a3e970838567bbd, https://si.imgix.net/514d7c3c/uploads/origins/4924a397-e1df-46a8-890c-cc889aede510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db045f5208bf1811ba51efa074fd91da 2x, https://si.imgix.net/514d7c3c/uploads/origins/4924a397-e1df-46a8-890c-cc889aede510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f23039b208c3570601b4ef823034d4dd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。私のOCが目に留まったようで嬉しい限りです。私のキャラクターSherylにリクエストがあります。彼女はクールでセクシーで自信に満ち溢れた海賊で、物事が自分の思い通りにならないときは銃を抜いて撃ち始めることを恐れない。\n\nポーズ、表情、背景はお任せします。衣装は赤いものを使っていただければと思います。よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/22epdrynjfnu?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NM_syndrome/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/64a130e9/uploads/origins/11449ebc-b821-4d90-a949-c9f3b54a60b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40b2bc44c559ca8cc4e87bdba52f5888", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/64a130e9/uploads/origins/11449ebc-b821-4d90-a949-c9f3b54a60b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40b2bc44c559ca8cc4e87bdba52f5888, https://si.imgix.net/64a130e9/uploads/origins/11449ebc-b821-4d90-a949-c9f3b54a60b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47ba23238332fb7048dda49217edcfdf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/64a130e9/uploads/origins/11449ebc-b821-4d90-a949-c9f3b54a60b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab675d093ee1f4b4031a332afdab90e0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, apologies for the odd request, but I recently went to a website that would have AI create images from prompts you entered into it. I received a rather haunting image from the prompt of “Nanoha and Madoka”, and I wished for you to draw something inspired by it. I also included some of the other drawings it produced, but the very first one was the one I most wished to see you replicate.\n\nI think it would be called the “Witch of Friendship”. Its appearance causes others to cower before it in terror. It extends its arm out to these people, wishing to be friends with them, but without any hands, it cannot support or comfort them. This causes the Witch to feel depressed, but still, it continues to reach its arm out, hoping endlessly that one day it will be able to grab hold of someone and become their friend.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/vtnpnpU", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}